OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFines of #100 for dog owners in
OL,4,Aexclusion zones
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrivate enforcement officers in parts
OL,7,Fof West Sussex will soon begin issuing
OL,8,F#100 on-the-spot fines to those
OL,9,Fbreaching dog exclusion zones.
OL,11,FAdur and Worthing Borough Councils are
OL,12,Fexpanding the use of the officers from
OL,13,F1 September following a 12-month trial
OL,14,Ftargeting littering and dog fouling.
OL,16,FYear-round dog exclusion zones include
OL,17,Fall fenced children's playgrounds and
OL,18,FHighdown Gardens, while the beach
OL,19,Fbetween Splash Point and Heene Road is
OL,20,Fenforced between 1 May and 30
OL,21,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
