OL,3,GNEWSAFines of #100 for dog owners in
OL,4,Aexclusion zones
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorthing Borough Council said that many
OL,7,Fof the restrictions had been in place
OL,8,Ffor more than a decade, but now
OL,9,Fofficers will actively enforce them.
